                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amin, nawaambia, Ye yote atakayeuambia mlima huu, Ng’oka ukatupwe baharini, wala asione shaka moyoni mwake, ila aamini kwamba hayo asemayo yametukia, yatakuwa yake. ",
          "type": "text",
