                "loc": "LUK.20.1+LUK.20.2+LUK.20.3+LUK.20.4+LUK.20.5+LUK.20.6+LUK.20.7+LUK.20.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 20:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakafika Yerusalemu tena; hata alipokuwa akitembea hekaluni, walimwendea wakuu wa makuhani, na waandishi, na wazee, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamwambia, Ni kwa mamlaka gani unatenda mambo haya? Naye ni nani aliyekupa mamlaka hii uyatende haya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akawaambia, Nitawauliza neno moja, nanyi mnijibu, kisha nitawaambia ni kwa mamlaka gani nayatenda haya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubatizo wa Yohana ulitoka mbinguni, au kwa wanadamu? Nijibuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasemezana wao kwa wao, wakisema, Kama tukisema, Ulitoka mbinguni, atasema, Mbona, basi, hamkumwamini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ila tukisema, Ulitoka kwa wanadamu, – waliogopa watu; maana watu wote walimwona Yohana kuwa nabii halisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamjibu Yesu, wakasema, Hatujui. Yesu akawaambia, Wala mimi siwaambii ninyi ni kwa mamlaka gani nayatenda haya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
